  "title": "ThinkSR: compact thought, dense output",
  "lang": "en",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The method is a linear image-to-image flow, while recurrence returns only to the thought stage.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes features, then windows, then a compact thought process updates the carrier before decoding. The recurrence is local to the DQ-CTM thought stage, so it does not send the image back through the whole pipeline. The same DQ-CTM parameters are reused across ticks.",
